@----------------------------------------
@node FUNCDEFS
@prev DSTRUCTS
@next VARIADICFNS
@toc INDEX
@{h1}Function Definition

Includes return type, name, parameter list, either an assembly block,
or a function body.

<funcdecl>      ::= <rettype> <ident> "(" <arglist> ")"  <asm> | <stmnt_block>

Function call used as an expression,
when used as a statement, a semicolon is appended.

<call_expr>     ::= [ <ident> | <built-in-function> ] "(" [ <exprlist> ] ")"

<funccall_stmt> ::= <call_expr> ";"

<rettype>       ::= "void" | <type>
